{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H4、H7、H10、H13、H14已经确立了在乎带来的喜悦、快乐将逝的感觉及由此产生的警觉，这里只是把温柔与不舍并存的心理因果说清，没有新增往事或改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"末句“仍不足以让他从此不必一直靠承受来维持”重新把持续承受写成维持这份在乎的必要条件，与H9已经确立的“不时时维持坚强，也能继续珍惜并得到快乐”相冲突，使主线退回了必须靠持续用力来维持的状态。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"急切、身体先于念头绷紧、无法继续维持紧张以及持续用力带来的消耗，都能接在H1、H6、H8、H10、H14及M31、M40、M41上，属于已有历史的局部因果展开，没有把音乐变化直接当成心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"反复反问、重放可能性以及思考逐渐变成不让自己停下的办法，是从H1、H2的疑惑反复出现和H8、H14的问题持续存在中延伸出的具体心理过程，并未断言发生过任何新的往事或外部事件。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条都交代了当下的感受及其心理因果，即使不看听感记录，也能跟上在乎、快乐将逝、持续不安与身体和思绪反应之间的联系。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "376bf74e-56a3-4edc-ad12-e1865d2962be", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T134925931439Z", "elapsed_seconds": 359.0, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:55:24.949985+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9dadfd2002d2cddb1e4d9d637683cad6b3460f6dabad2d2570f784aed181a561", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "D